join "Ial Tutor" (Default) center [animation="Fade In"]

if {Order.IalOrder} == true:

	"Ial Tutor": Just who I wanted to see! Do you have my order, dear?

	- Yes, Here you go! | [if {Order.OrderFilled} == true]

		"Ial Tutor": Oh thank you! They are just wonderful! For your trouble.


		if {Global.inventory_manager.has_item_amount(17,1)}:
			do Global.economy_manager.sell_flower(17, 1)
		else:
			do Global.economy_manager.sell_flower(7, 1)


		if {Global.inventory_manager.has_item_amount(15,2)}:
			do Global.economy_manager.sell_flower(15, 2)

		elif {Global.inventory_manager.has_item_amount(15,1)}:
			do Global.economy_manager.sell_flower(15, 1)
			do Global.economy_manager.sell_flower(5, 1)

		else:
			do Global.economy_manager.sell_flower(5, 2)


	- No, Sorry.

		"Ial Tutor": That's ok, sweetie.


	- Actually, I wanted to chat a bit!

		"Ial Tutor": Oh really? Sorry dear, I'm busy now. You can talk to me after my chat gets written!

else:

	"Ial Tutor": Hello! Wonderful day, is it not?

leave "Ial Tutor" [animation="Fade Out"]